  "notes": "Cause code TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields (no official cause code assigned in block 13, which is empty). Narrative describes direct/apparent/contributing causes but official cause_code and category are not coded, so cause node is marked provisional per rule 4. Handswitch was deliberately placed OFF as a pre-planned compensatory measure during the Train A BOP-ESFAS outage, not itself a failure mode, so not modeled as a FailureMode; it is modeled as a Component contributing to why the EDG did not auto-start. Previous similar event LER key recorded exactly as stated in narrative ('50-530/2024-002-00') per rule 9, despite differing format from this LER's own docket-based key."
